  "files": [
    {
      "name": "index.html",
      "path": "index.html",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Clicker App</title>\n  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-gray-100 flex flex-col items-center min-h-screen p-4\">\n  <header class=\"my-6 text-center\">\n    <h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-indigo-700\">🖱️ Clicker App</h1>\n    <p class=\"text-gray-600 mt-2\">Tap the button, earn points, and buy upgrades!</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"w-full max-w-md bg-white rounded-lg shadow-lg p-6 flex flex-col items-center\">\n    <!-- Counter -->\n    <div class=\"text-3xl font-semibold mb-4\" id=\"counter\">0</div>\n\n    <!-- Click button -->\n    <button id=\"clickBtn\"\n            class=\"w-48 h-16 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-bold rounded-full transition transform active:scale-95 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-400 mb-6\">\n      Click Me!\n    </button>\n\n    <!-- Upgrades -->\n    <section class=\"w-full\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Upgrades</h2>\n\n      <!-- Click Multiplier Upgrade -->\n      <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded mb-3\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"font-medium\">Click Power (+1 per click)</p>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\" id=\"multiplierCost\">Cost: 10</p>\n        </div>\n        <button id=\"buyMultiplier\"\n                class=\"bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\">\n          Buy\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Auto‑Clicker Upgrade -->\n      <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"font-medium\">Auto‑Clicker (+1 per sec)</p>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\" id=\"autoclickerCost\">Cost: 50</p>\n        </div>\n        <button id=\"buyAutoClicker\"\n                class=\"bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\">\n          Buy\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"mt-8 text-center text-gray-500 text-sm\">\n    © 2026 Clicker App – Open Source\n  </footer>\n\n  <script src=\"script.js\" defer></script>\n</body>\n</html>"
    },
    {
      "name": "style.css",
      "path": "style.css",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "/* style.css – custom overrides for the Clicker App */\n\n/* Ensure the click button stays circular on all devices */\n#clickBtn {\n  min-width: 12rem;\n  min-height: 4rem;\n}\n\n/* Small animation for counter updates */\n@keyframes pop {\n  0%   { transform: scale(1); }\n  30%  { transform: scale(1.2); }\n  100% { transform: scale(1); }\n}\n.counter-updated {\n  animation: pop 0.3s ease-out;\n}"
    },
    {
      "name": "script.js",
      "path": "script.js",
      "language": "javascript",
      "content": "/* script.js – Core game logic for Clicker App */\n'use strict';\n\n(() => {\n  // ----- Game State -----\n  const state = {\n    count: 0,\n    clickPower: 1,          // points per manual click\n    autoClickRate: 0,       // points per second (auto‑clicker)\n    multiplierCost: 10,\n    autoClickerCost: 50,\n  };\n\n  // ----- DOM Elements -----\n  const counterEl = document.getElementById('counter');\n  const clickBtn = document.getElementById('clickBtn');\n  const buyMultiplierBtn = document.getElementById('buyMultiplier');\n  const buyAutoClickerBtn = document.getElementById('buyAutoClicker');\n  const multiplierCostEl = document.getElementById('multiplierCost');\n  const autoClickerCostEl = document.getElementById('autoclickerCost');\n\n  // ----- Persistence -----\n  const STORAGE_KEY = 'clickerAppState';\n\n  function loadState() {\n    const saved = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);\n    if (saved) {\n      try {\n        const parsed = JSON.parse(saved);\n        Object.assign(state, parsed);\n      } catch (e) {\n        console.warn('Failed to parse saved state:', e);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  function saveState() {\n    localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(state));\n  }\n\n  // ----- UI Updates -----\n  function updateCounter() {\n    counterEl.textContent = Math.floor(state.count);\n    counterEl.classList.add('counter-updated');\n    setTimeout(() => counterEl.classList.remove('counter-updated'), 300);\n  }\n\n  function updateUpgradeButtons() {\n    // Multiplier\n    multiplierCostEl.textContent = `Cost: ${state.multiplierCost}`;\n    buyMultiplierBtn.disabled = state.count < state.multiplierCost;\n\n    // Auto‑Clicker\n    autoClickerCostEl.textContent = `Cost: ${state.autoClickerCost}`;\n    buyAutoClickerBtn.disabled = state.count < state.autoClickerCost;\n  }\n\n  function refreshUI() {\n    updateCounter();\n    updateUpgradeButtons();\n  }\n\n  // ----- Game Mechanics -----\n  function handleClick() {\n    state.count += state.clickPower;\n    refreshUI();\n    saveState();\n  }\n\n  function purchaseMultiplier() {\n    if (state.count >= state.multiplierCost) {\n      state.count -= state.multiplierCost;\n      state.clickPower += 1;\n      // Exponential cost scaling\n      state.multiplierCost = Math.round(state.multiplierCost * 1.5);\n      refreshUI();\n      saveState();\n    }\n  }\n\n  function purchaseAutoClicker() {\n    if (state.count >= state.autoClickerCost) {\n      state.count -= state.autoClickerCost;\n      state.autoClickRate += 1;\n      state.autoClickerCost = Math.round(state.autoClickerCost * 1.7);\n      refreshUI();\n      saveState();\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Auto‑clicker loop (runs once per second)\n  function startAutoClicker() {\n    setInterval(() => {\n      if (state.autoClickRate > 0) {\n        state.count += state.autoClickRate;\n        refreshUI();\n        saveState();\n      }\n    }, 1000);\n  }\n\n  // ----- Event Listeners -----\n  function bindEvents() {\n    clickBtn.addEventListener('click', handleClick);\n    buyMultiplierBtn.addEventListener('click', purchaseMultiplier);\n    buyAutoClickerBtn.addEventListener('click', purchaseAutoClicker);\n  }\n\n  // ----- Init -----\n  function init() {\n    loadState();\n    bindEvents();\n    startAutoClicker();\n    refreshUI();\n  }\n\n  // Run when DOM is ready\n  if (document.readyState === 'loading') {\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);\n  } else {\n    init();\n  }\n})();"
    },
    {
      "name": "README.md",
      "path": "README.md",
      "language": "markdown",
      "content": "# Clicker App\n\nA simple, responsive clicker game built with vanilla JavaScript, Tailwind CSS, and `localStorage` persistence.  \nTap the button to earn points, then spend those points on upgrades that increase your click power or generate points automatically.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Instant click feedback** with a smooth counter animation.\n- **Upgrade system**:\n  - **Click Power** – each purchase adds +1 point per manual click.\n  - **Auto‑Clicker** – each purchase adds +1 point per second.\n- **Progress persistence** using `localStorage` (state survives page reloads).\n- **Responsive UI** built with Tailwind CSS.\n- No external build tools – just open `index.html` in a browser.\n\n## Demo\n\n![Clicker App screenshot](https://i.imgur.com/your-screenshot.png)\n\n*(Replace the image URL with an actual screenshot if you host one.)*\n\n## Getting Started\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- A modern web browser (Chrome, Firefox, Edge, Safari, etc.).\n- No server required – the app runs completely client‑side.\n\n### Installation\n\n1. Clone the repository or download the source files."
    }
  ]
}